## Simulation conceptuelle (pseudo-code)

```python
def retroaction(E, I, R):
    cycle = integrate(E, I, R)
    if test_vide(cycle):
        return reset_zero(cycle)
    return cycle

Vie = retroaction(Energie, Information, Relation)
```

